sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Renderer (ChatInput/PermissionCard)
  participant Host as maker-host (omp-host)
  participant Agent as OmpAgent
  participant Handle as OmpSessionHandle
  participant RPC as OmpRpcClient
  participant Tr as OmpTranslator
  participant Br as OmpPermissionBridge
  participant OMP as omp --mode rpc (子进程)
  participant Proxy as anthropic-compat-proxy (loopback)
  participant DB as localDb (sessions)

  Note over Host,DB: ① 新建会话
  UI->>Host: createSession(agentKind='omp', workingDir, model, permissionMode)
  Host->>Host: resolveOmpBinary() + vet (pin/sha256/size, isVettedAgentBinaryPath)
  Host->>Host: materializeOmpAgentHome(): 写 models.yml(provider cindy, baseUrl=loopback, apiKey=$CINDY_OMP_PROXY_KEY, headers=session-id/token)
  Host->>Agent: new OmpAgent(deps) → startSession(opts)
  Agent->>Agent: createOmpSessionLaunchPlan(cwd=workingDir, HOME=omp-agent-home, --approval-mode=map(mode), --provider cindy --model m)
  Agent->>OMP: spawn(argv, env快照, 不合并process.env)
  OMP-->>Agent: ready {protocolVersion:1, maxFrameBytes:1MiB}
  Agent->>RPC: new OmpRpcClient(streamTransport)
  Agent->>RPC: request(new_session)
  RPC->>OMP: {type:new_session, id}
  OMP-->>RPC: response success
  Agent->>RPC: request(get_state)
  OMP-->>RPC: {sessionId, sessionFile, model, thinkingLevel}
  Agent->>DB: 落库 sessions.sdkSessionId = sessionFile
  Agent-->>Host: OmpSessionHandle
  Host-->>UI: session started (capabilities 三档权限)

  Note over UI,OMP: ② 发消息 + 流式事件投影
  UI->>Handle: send({type:'user', content})
  Handle->>RPC: request(prompt {message})
  RPC->>OMP: {type:prompt, id:omp-N}
  OMP-->>RPC: response ACK (success)
  loop 事件流
    OMP-->>RPC: agent_start / turn_start / message_start
    OMP-->>RPC: message_update(text/thinking/toolcall delta)
    RPC-->>Tr: frame
    Tr-->>Handle: AgentEvent text/thinking/tool_use/tool_result
    Handle-->>UI: events (按 sessionId+windowId 绑定, 拒绝迟到/跨会话)
    OMP-->>RPC: tool_execution_start/update/end (update>1MiB→截断标注)
    OMP-->>RPC: turn_end / agent_end(isTerminal:true)
    Tr-->>Handle: done
  end

  Note over OMP,UI: ③ 权限确认 (extension_ui_request method:confirm, 字段形态待定-防御设计)
  OMP-->>RPC: extension_ui_request {id, method:'confirm', ..., requestGeneration?}
  RPC-->>Br: frame (快照 requestGeneration 若存在)
  alt 已有 pending 或会话不匹配
    Br->>RPC: respondToUi(id, {cancelled:true})
  else 正常
    Br-->>Handle: InteractionRequest{kind:'permission', toolName, input}
    Handle-->>UI: interaction_request → PermissionPrompt 卡片
    alt 用户决策 (30s 内)
      UI-->>Br: allow/deny
      Br->>RPC: respondToUi(id, {confirmed:bool}, {requestGeneration})
      RPC->>OMP: {type:extension_ui_response, id, confirmed, requestGeneration?}
    else 超时 (min(frame.timeout,60s), 默认30s)
      Br->>RPC: respondToUi(id, {cancelled:true, timedOut:true})
      Br-->>UI: interaction_dismissed + SystemCard「已按拒绝处理」
    end
  end
  Note over Br: open_url → cancelled + 提示卡(不自动打开); 未知 method → cancelled + 脱敏日志

  Note over UI,OMP: ④ 会话中途切档 (热切换=重启续接)
  UI->>Handle: setPermissionMode('auto')
  Handle->>OMP: 关闭 stdin (draining 优雅退出, ≤10s)
  Handle->>Handle: 重生成 launch plan (--approval-mode write) → spawn
  OMP-->>Handle: ready
  Handle->>RPC: request(switch_session {sessionPath: 旧sessionFile})
  OMP-->>RPC: success
  Handle->>RPC: request(get_state) → 校验 sessionId 未漂移
  Handle-->>UI: 状态「权限设置已应用」(失败→回滚旧档+提示)

  Note over Host,Proxy: 模型请求凭证链 (每请求)
  OMP->>Proxy: POST /v1/messages (x-cindy-omp-provider-id, session-id/token, 占位key)
  Proxy->>Proxy: 按 provider 头钉住 omp 路由, 校验 session token, 替换真实授权
  Proxy-->>OMP: 流式响应 (凭证永不落盘、不经 OMP)
